      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the process in the Pathology Department, begin with the Gross pathology request that has arrived."
      ],
      "justification": "Implicit start node plus initialization and receipt actions derived directly from the opening instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, proceed with the Registration gross pathology request."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the registration step instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the registration is complete, assign a container to the gross pathology request."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact mapping to the container assignment step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "During the \"Registration gross pathology request\" step, make sure to create a barcode scan at the start."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the barcode creation instruction with faithful semantics."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "For the \"Specimen description\" step, pay attention to the scan start."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps directly to initiating the specimen description scan."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Then, pay attention to the scan end."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps directly to terminating the scan."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, pay attention to the scan start again for the Registration gross pathology request (cont.) step."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps directly to restarting the scan for the continuation phase."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9",
        "action:n10",
        "action:n17",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following that, proceed with Macroscopic description writing. Simultaneously, complete the following steps: Tissue processing, check if \"Digitalization?\" is required."
      ],
      "justification": "The AND gateway correctly models the explicit 'Simultaneously' concurrency. Actions cover macroscopic writing, tissue processing (including an acceptable redundant variant), and the initial digitalization check."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "converge:c3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following that, proceed with Macroscopic description writing. Simultaneously, complete the following steps: Tissue processing, check if \"Digitalization?\" is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural converge handles the implicit re-join of the simultaneous (AND) paths initiated in this span."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the answer is \"no,\" continue the process.",
        "If the answer is \"yes,\" proceed with Digitalization."
      ],
      "justification": "Accurately models the first digitalization decision point, including positive/negative guards, resulting action branches, and implicit convergence."
    },
    {
